## **PHASE 2: INCREMENTAL/CDC FRAMEWORK - SOURCE-AGNOSTIC (Weeks 9-14)**

### **2.1 Core Abstraction (Week 9)**
```python
# Interfaces to implement
IncrementalStrategyBase:
  - get_last_state(dataset) → Dict
  - get_changes(dataset, since) → DataFrame
  - write_changes(dataset, changes, mode) → WriteResult
  - get_current_state(dataset) → Dict

IncrementalConfig:
  strategy: WATERMARK | CDC | FILE_MANIFEST | DELTA_CDF | CURSOR | OFFSET | CHANGE_FEED
  watermark_column, lookback_window, partition_strategy, idempotency_key, scd_type
```

### **2.2 Strategy Implementations (Weeks 10-12)**

| Priority | Strategy | Sources | Key Features |
|----------|----------|---------|--------------|
| **P0** | Watermark | SQL, any timestamped | Auto-detect column, lookback, SCD 1/2 |
| **P0** | File Manifest | Blob, ADLS, Local, S3 | Hash-based, partition by date, schema evolution |
| **P1** | Delta CDF | Fabric, Databricks, ADLS Gen2 | Native CDF, time travel, OPTIMIZE, VACUUM |
| **P1** | CDC (Debezium/SQL) | PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQL Server | Log-based, exactly-once, schema changes |
| **P2** | API Cursor | REST, GraphQL | Pagination, rate limits, auth refresh |
| **P2** | Kafka Offset | Event Hubs, Kafka | Consumer groups, exactly-once, replay |
| **P3** | Change Feed | Cosmos DB, DynamoDB | Stream processing, TTL handling |

### **2.3 Unified Planner Integration (Weeks 13-14)**
- [ ] **Auto-detect strategy** per dataset from source metadata
- [ ] **Generate incremental steps**: get_state → fetch_changes → transform → write → update_state
- [ ] **Source-specific compilers** for each strategy (T-SQL MERGE, Delta CDF, API upsert, etc.)
- [ ] **Idempotency guarantees** via deterministic keys per strategy

**Phase 2 Success Criteria:**
- [ ] Same pipeline config works for SQL, Blob, Delta, API, Kafka
- [ ] Incremental runs 10x faster than full refresh
- [ ] Zero data loss on re-runs (idempotent)
- [ ] Handles late-arriving data via lookback window

