## **RISK MITIGATION**

| Risk | Probability | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|-------------|--------|------------|
| LLM semantic refinement too slow | Medium | High | Cache aggressively, batch ambiguous cols, fallback to patterns |
| CDC setup complexity per source | High | High | Start with Watermark + File Manifest (covers 80%), add CDC incrementally |
| Multi-dialect codegen divergence | Medium | High | Shared IR (Intermediate Representation) → dialect compilers |
| Human gate bottleneck | Low | Medium | Auto-approve for low-risk, batch gates, async notifications |
| Memory store scale | Low | Medium | Redis Cluster, partition by tenant, TTL policies |
| Schema evolution breaking contracts | Medium | High | Contract compatibility checks in CI, versioned contracts |

